      "kind": "shape",
      "text": "HIGHLIGHTS\nTop contributors to increm. revenue\nCredit Cards contribute +$145MM (incl.$32MM one-time item), led by Mexico volume-driven NII growth (+12% CAGR) and Peru on spread expansion (+152 bps)\nSPL is the largest underlying driven, with +$70MM led by Mexico and Peru volume growth and Mexico NIM expansion\nDemand Deposits deliver +$102MM, , driven by UY and Chile on strong balance growth\n\nTop detractors to incremental revenue\nSavings is the largest drag, driven by Uruguay  and sharp balance contraction (-49%)\nOther Loans decline -$33MM, driven by Uruguay\n",
      "placeholder": null,
